8. Conclusion

The existing Student Management System can be modernized through a combination of software maintenance, software reengineering, and AI-assisted software engineering.

Software maintenance helps correct errors and improve existing functionalities, while software reengineering transforms outdated code and architecture into a modern and efficient system. AI-assisted tools further improve software quality by supporting bug detection, code optimization, and automated testing.

By combining these techniques, the college can achieve a faster, more secure, reliable, and user-friendly Student Management System that meets current and future requirements.
